<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine coast guard seizes Spanish fishing boat.</title>
<headline>Argentine coast guard seizes Spanish fishing boat.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Coast Guard said Wednesday it had captured a Spanish fishing boat operating illegally in Argentine waters.</p>
<p>The &quot;Arpon&quot; was captured Tuesday along with a crew of 25 carrying 626 tonnes of squid and four tonnes of hake some 200 miles (320 km) miles off the coast of southern Buenos Aires province.</p>
<p>The Arpon was being escorted to the Argentine port of Bahia Blanca, the coast guard said.</p>
<p>It provided no details of what would be done with the boat or her crew.</p>
<p>(( -- Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
